Icons in this directory
=======================

These images are copied unchanged from Biogenesis 0.9
(https://biogenesis.sourceforge.net/): biogenesis.png is its application
icon and menu_*.png are its toolbar and menu icons. Biogenesis distributes
them in its source release, licensed under the GNU General Public License
version 2 or later (see LICENSE at the top of this repository), and credits
its artwork to Ananda Daydream and Florian Haag
(http://toolbaricons.sourceforge.net/).

menu_backup.png, used by the colour build, is copied unchanged from the
source release of Biogenesis Color Mod 2.01 (Copyright (C) 2012-2022
MarcoDBAA), under the same licence; Color Mod does not say who drew it.

Biogenesis does not record which icon is by which artist. Florian Haag's
Toolbar Icons are released under the MIT License; its notice, as shipped in
ToolbarIcons-src-20100505.tar.gz, follows.

